{"seq":2,"slug":"qual-quant-spectrum","title":"定性与定量方法谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/design-research/foundations/qual-quant-spectrum","wordCount":1433,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"定性与定量方法谱系\">定性与定量方法谱系</h1><p>&quot;该用访谈还是问卷？&quot;是设计研究中最频繁、也最容易答错的问题。把它简化成&quot;定性 vs 定量&quot;的二选一，会错过真正决定选型的两个独立维度。本篇用一个二维坐标把所有常见方法摆进同一张地图，让你能根据&quot;想回答什么问题&quot;反推方法，而不是凭手感或团队习惯选方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>方法选型有两个正交的轴，混淆它们是大多数误用的根源。第一个轴是<strong>数据形态</strong>：定性（语言、行为、故事，回答&quot;为什么/怎么样&quot;）还是定量（数字、频率、占比，回答&quot;多少/哪个更好&quot;）。第二个轴是<strong>研究情境</strong>：态度式（attitudinal，人们说什么）还是行为式（behavioral，人们做什么）。两轴交叉出四个象限，每个象限对应不同的方法族。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[研究问题] --&gt; A{想知道&lt;br/&gt;为什么 还是 多少?}&#10;  A --&gt;|为什么/怎么样| QUAL[定性]&#10;  A --&gt;|多少/哪个更好| QUANT[定量]&#10;  QUAL --&gt; B{说 还是 做?}&#10;  QUANT --&gt; C{说 还是 做?}&#10;  B --&gt;|说| D[深度访谈&lt;br/&gt;焦点小组]&#10;  B --&gt;|做| E[情境观察&lt;br/&gt;民族志]&#10;  C --&gt;|说| F[问卷量表]&#10;  C --&gt;|做| G[A/B 测试&lt;br/&gt;行为埋点]\">flowchart TD\n  Q[研究问题] --&gt; A{想知道&lt;br/&gt;为什么 还是 多少?}\n  A --&gt;|为什么/怎么样| QUAL[定性]\n  A --&gt;|多少/哪个更好| QUANT[定量]\n  QUAL --&gt; B{说 还是 做?}\n  QUANT --&gt; C{说 还是 做?}\n  B --&gt;|说| D[深度访谈&lt;br/&gt;焦点小组]\n  B --&gt;|做| E[情境观察&lt;br/&gt;民族志]\n  C --&gt;|说| F[问卷量表]\n  C --&gt;|做| G[A/B 测试&lt;br/&gt;行为埋点]</pre><p>下表把四个象限的代表方法、能回答的问题与典型陷阱对照，每个方法都指向 hub 中的主讲篇章：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>象限</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>擅长回答</th>\n<th>典型陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定性·态度</td>\n<td><a href=\"../qualitative/depth-interviews\">深度访谈</a></td>\n<td>动机、心智模型、未满足需求</td>\n<td>把&quot;想要&quot;当&quot;会用&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定性·行为</td>\n<td><a href=\"../qualitative/contextual-ethnography\">情境观察与民族志</a></td>\n<td>真实流程、变通做法、环境约束</td>\n<td>观察者效应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定量·态度</td>\n<td><a href=\"../testing-quant/survey-scale-design\">问卷与量表</a></td>\n<td>态度分布、满意度趋势</td>\n<td>自陈偏差、措辞诱导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定量·行为</td>\n<td><a href=\"../testing-quant/ab-behavioral-data\">A/B 测试与行为数据</a></td>\n<td>哪个方案转化更高</td>\n<td>知其然不知其所以然</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"说与做之间的鸿沟\">说与做之间的鸿沟</h2><p>设计研究里最危险的假设，是&quot;人们说的就是人们会做的&quot;。访谈中受访者由衷地说&quot;我很在意隐私&quot;，转身却把所有权限一键授予了一个换脸 App。这不是受访者撒谎，而是<strong>态度数据与行为数据测量的是不同的东西</strong>：前者是经过自我叙事过滤的理性表达，后者是真实情境下被习惯、惰性、社会压力共同塑造的结果。</p>\n<p>成熟的研究设计因此倾向<strong>态度与行为交叉验证</strong>。当问卷显示满意度上升、而行为数据显示留存下降时，矛盾本身就是最有价值的线索——它往往指向一个&quot;嘴上认可、实际放弃&quot;的隐性问题。把两类数据放在一起读，比任何单一来源都更接近真相。</p>\n<h2 id=\"样本量背后的两套逻辑\">样本量背后的两套逻辑</h2><p>定性与定量对&quot;多少样本才够&quot;的回答，遵循完全不同的统计逻辑，混用会同时浪费钱和得出错误结论。</p>\n<p>定性研究追求的是<strong>主题饱和（saturation）</strong>：当新增受访者不再带来新主题时即可停止。经验上，针对相对同质的用户群，深访通常在 5 到 8 人后接近饱和；评估式可用性测试中，Jakob Nielsen 的经典结论是 5 名用户可发现约 85% 的严重可用性问题，因此采取&quot;小批量、多轮迭代&quot;远比一次性大样本高效（来源：Nielsen Norman Group，<em>Why You Only Need to Test with 5 Users</em>）。</p>\n<p>定量研究追求的是<strong>统计功效（statistical power）</strong>：样本量由效应量、显著性水平 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 与功效 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 共同决定。比较两个比例时，所需样本量近似为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\approx \\frac{(z_{1-\\alpha/2} + z_{1-\\beta})^2 \\cdot 2\\bar{p}(1-\\bar{p})}{(p_1 - p_2)^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4953em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5593em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_1, p_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为两组的预期转化率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7622em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为其均值。这个式子的直觉是：要检测的差异越小（分母越小），需要的样本就越多。这正是为什么 A/B 测试微小改动往往需要数万曝光。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把方法串成研究流\">把方法串成研究流</h2><p>单一方法几乎无法独立支撑一个完整决策，混合方法（mixed methods）才是常态。两种最有用的串法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>探索→量化（先定性后定量）</strong>：用深访发现&quot;用户其实分成两类完全不同的人&quot;，再用问卷量出每类占比，把质性洞察规模化。</li>\n<li><strong>量化→解释（先定量后定性）</strong>：行为数据显示某页跳出率异常高，再用可用性测试或情境观察解释&quot;为什么会跳出&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选哪种串法取决于你当前最大的未知是&quot;有哪些可能性&quot;（用探索式打头）还是&quot;为什么会这样&quot;（用解释式收尾）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"谱系不是鄙视链\">谱系不是鄙视链</h2><p>新手常默认&quot;定量更科学、定性是软数据&quot;。这是个昂贵的误解。定量回答&quot;是什么、有多少&quot;却几乎无法回答&quot;为什么&quot;；定性能挖出动机却无法告诉你&quot;这适用于多大比例的人&quot;。两者是互补的镜头而非高下之分。真正的专业度体现在：面对一个具体问题，能说清&quot;这个问题该用谱系里的哪个点、为什么不是相邻的那个点&quot;。后续每一篇方法文档，都是在教你把某一个谱系坐标用到极致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>方法选型有两个正交轴：数据形态（定性/定量）与研究情境（态度/行为），交叉出四象限方法地图。</li>\n<li>&quot;说与做&quot;之间存在系统性鸿沟，态度数据与行为数据应交叉验证，矛盾本身即线索。</li>\n<li>定性按主题饱和定样本（深访约 5–8 人，可用性测试约 5 人/轮）；定量按统计功效定样本。</li>\n<li>混合方法是常态，两种主串法为&quot;探索→量化&quot;与&quot;量化→解释&quot;，按当前最大未知选择。</li>\n<li>定性与定量是互补镜头而非鄙视链，专业度在于为具体问题精确定位谱系坐标。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"定性与定量方法谱系","id":"定性与定量方法谱系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"说与做之间的鸿沟","id":"说与做之间的鸿沟"},{"level":2,"text":"样本量背后的两套逻辑","id":"样本量背后的两套逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"把方法串成研究流","id":"把方法串成研究流"},{"level":2,"text":"谱系不是鄙视链","id":"谱系不是鄙视链"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"设计研究的角色与价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/design-research/foundations/role-and-value"},"next":{"title":"研究伦理与参与者招募","url":"/l-doc-books/h/design-thinking/design-research/foundations/ethics-recruiting"}}